This repository contains multiple packages with different licenses.
Each package's specific license terms are located in that package's directory.

PACKAGE LICENSING OVERVIEW:

1. OPEN SOURCE PACKAGES (MIT License)
   - libs/core/       Core translation engine and shared utilities
   - libs/i18n/       Internationalization and language data
   - libs/language-server/  Language Server Protocol implementation
   - libs/vs-code/    VS Code editor integration

   These packages are freely available under the MIT License.
   See individual package LICENSE files for full terms.

2. DUAL-LICENSED PACKAGE (MIT + Commercial)
   - libs/legesher/   Main package with CLI and primary API

   Free Tier: Available under MIT License for personal and open source use
   Premium Tier: Requires commercial license for cloud features, team management,
                 and advanced functionality

3. PROPRIETARY PACKAGES (Source Available)
   - libs/home/       Community features and project showcase

   These packages are source-available for reference and security review only.
   Commercial use requires a separate license agreement.
   Contact: sales@legesher.com

